  "translation": "Gomme wena o tla theelela go tšwa magodimo, mme o dirile, mme o ahlotše ⟨את⟩ mehlanka ya gago — go busetša yo phoko, go bea tsela ya gagwe ka thogo ya gagwe, le go lokiša yo a lokilego, go mo nea go ya ka tsedeke ya gagwe.",
